# AI agent modes and the harness > The map — what is part of what
# ipm-overview:docs/use-cases/agent-modes.md#L53
# ef1b92d59b7512ac69f84f6910bebca21635b2ee

# The general event every run is a kind of. A specific run EXPRESSES it — it is
# not contained by it: a read run does not happen inside some larger "run the
# mode", it is one of that kind. Containment is the other tree, below.
general::a Run the mode ::e

# The chain that moves a change along. It ends at the whole attempt, not inside
# it: an update run happens within its envelope.
design::a Run the design mode ::e
  --> validate::a Run the validate mode ::e
  --> review::a Run the review mode ::e
  --> attempt::a Attempt an update ::e

# Reading is a kind of run like the rest, tied to nothing in that chain: it can
# happen at any point, or not at all.
read::a Run the read mode ::e

update::a Run the update mode ::e --::P--> attempt
read, design, validate, review, update, attempt --::X--> general

# The change all of this is part of.
change::a Change the knowledge base ::e
design, validate, review, attempt --::P--> change
